              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, partial plate armour and shield. May wear full plate armour (+2 pts if dismounted). Has a halberd or a double-handed weapon. Different Weapons if dismounted. Different Weapons if dismounted. (Armies of Chivalry p.42)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
