              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, light armour, shield, and thrusting or throwing spear. May have heavy armour (+2 pts). Open Order. Combined formation; Turkopolen may be included in a unit of Brüder, they then lose their Open Order ability. (Armies of Chivalry p.42)</characteristic>
