              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow or javelin, and shield. May have light armour (+2 pts). Bow armed Native Cavalry are Skirmishers. Javelin armed Native Cavalry are Open Order. All have Feigned Flight. (Armies of Chivalry p.43)</characteristic>
