              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each gun has a crew of three; two additional crew may be added (+10 pts each). Crewmen have hand weapon and light armour and may upgrade to heavy armour (+2 pts). Light artillery range 36", Strength 6. Artillery: up to one gun for every 1,000 army points (bought from the Infantry allocation). May have one gun per 1,000 army points. (Armies of Chivalry p.43)</characteristic>
